[gd_scene load_steps=4 format=3 uid="uid://unitmatmipbiasnrm"]

; One variable: the project's `texture_mipmap_bias`, -0.5, on a normal map's reads. A 256 x 256 map
; of 8-texel stripes leaning 45 degrees towards +X and -X tiles a lit grey floor at the editor view's
; oblique angle. Each level averages the stripes towards flat, so the bias keeps the far stripes'
; light and dark bands where a bias of 0 lets them fade to an even grey. No other golden biases a
; normal map.

